          {
            "parameter": "old",
            "value": "mockOldRecord"
          },
          {
            "parameter": "fullSignature",
            "value": "false"
          }
        ],
        "expected": "initHmac() is NOT invoked; null is passed to the private generate method; the returned TSIGRecord equals the stubbed value for a null Mac.",
        "description": "Verify that for a different non\u2011init error (SERVFAIL) the method behaves like FORMERR \u2013 no HMAC is created."
